#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Magic technology file for ICsprout 55LLULP 1P6M (icsprout55)
#
# GENERATED by hacking/magic/gen_magic_tech.py from the vendor Calibre LVS runset,
# the StarRC ITF and the Calibre DRC deck. Do not edit; change the generator.
#
# Internal units: lambda = 10 nm, GDS grid down to 1 nm.
# Metal stack: MET1-MET5, T4M2 (top metal), RDL; vias VIA1-VIA4, T4V2, RV.
#
# Magic only handles GDS layer / datatype numbers up to 255. The Calibre layers below
# are above that; this file reads them as (layer - 256, datatype + 100), e.g. NODRC
# 357/12 as 101/112. Vendor GDS has to be converted with hacking/magic/magic_gds.py
# for Magic to see them (SUBCKTLVS substrate cuts, NODRC, PSUB native devices, HRPBLK,
# CHIPBLK boundary, WELTXT / SUBTXT well labels); in an unconverted GDS they are
# ignored. They are never written (GDS output from Magic does not contain them).
#   CAP CHIPBLK DEUPAD DMYBLK EFUSEALL FUSEALL FUSEDRC FUTR GRBLK HRPBLK INDALL INDDMY
#   INDVIA LATCHUP LDMOSSTI LOGO METBLK MOMCAP MOMLVS1 MOMLVS2 MOMLVS3 MOMLVS4 MOMLVS5
#   MOMLVS6 MOMTER MOSCKTLVS MOSMF NODRC NOEBBLK NOLVS NOSHRINK NPR OPCBLKALL POEFUSEBLK
#   PSUB RES3TPOLY RESCKTLVS RF5TERLVS RF6TERLVS RFSDLVS SRBLK SRINGBLK SUBCKTLVS SUBTXT
#   TTXT VARAJMRK VDD VSS WELTXT
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tech
  format 35
  ics55
end

